# Brain Master Runtime

## Position
position: Orchestrator layer
above: Hacedle Runtime
below: Aura Soul

## Responsibilities
- Receive SIO
- Resolve Soul
- Build Session
- Dispatch Runtime
- Collect Outcome
- Return SioOutcome

## Structure
structure:
  runtime.rs - BrainMasterRuntime orchestrator
  session.rs - BrainSession with soul/profile context
  dispatcher.rs - RuntimeDispatcher to providers
  outcome.rs - SioOutcome result format
  registry/ - Soul/Provider/Profile registries
  context/ - RuntimeSio builder
  execute/ - Execution pipeline

## Relationship
flow:
  RuntimeSio
    ↓
  BrainMasterRuntime
    ↓
  Hacetral Orch
    ↓
  Hacedle
    ↓
  Provider (Candle/Llama/ONNX/MLX/vLLM)

---